{
    "title": "Maple Tale",
    "description": "[Retro Pixel, Classic Reproduction] \r\nThe game uses classic cel-shading, designed in the style of traditional hand-drawn animation, combining exquisite visual effects with pixel art style to enhance visual impact and appeal.\r\n\r\n[Casual Idle, Easy Upgrades] \r\nCharacters' equipment, experience, potions, and other items can all be acquired through offline idle gameplay. With generous offline rewards and simple vertical idle gameplay, you can easily enhance your combat power anytime, anywhere!\r\n\r\n[Strategic Combos, Exciting Battles] \r\nUnlock new skills through character job changes, customize skill combinations, enjoy full-screen map clearing, and quickly develop your character to become a unique hero.\r\n\r\n[Team Challenges, Secret Realm Adventures] \r\nThere are not only rich team dungeons and various team gameplay options but also intense world boss battles, guild crafting, and brotherhood! Team up with friends to complete challenges and earn extra rewards!\r\n\r\n[Thousands of Outfits, Free Customization] \r\nEye-catching outfits like the Monkey King, Pirate Hunter, and Azure Mech! With a variety of outfits and abundant production, you can mix and match your desired sets as you wish!",
    "descriptionHTML": "[Retro Pixel, Classic Reproduction] <br>The game uses classic cel-shading, designed in the style of traditional hand-drawn animation, combining exquisite visual effects with pixel art style to enhance visual impact and appeal.<br><br>[Casual Idle, Easy Upgrades] <br>Characters&#39; equipment, experience, potions, and other items can all be acquired through offline idle gameplay. With generous offline rewards and simple vertical idle gameplay, you can easily enhance your combat power anytime, anywhere!<br><br>[Strategic Combos, Exciting Battles] <br>Unlock new skills through character job changes, customize skill combinations, enjoy full-screen map clearing, and quickly develop your character to become a unique hero.<br><br>[Team Challenges, Secret Realm Adventures] <br>There are not only rich team dungeons and various team gameplay options but also intense world boss battles, guild crafting, and brotherhood! Team up with friends to complete challenges and earn extra rewards!<br><br>[Thousands of Outfits, Free Customization] <br>Eye-catching outfits like the Monkey King, Pirate Hunter, and Azure Mech! With a variety of outfits and abundant production, you can mix and match your desired sets as you wish!",
